o>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>600</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>12</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>600</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>300</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>400</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ul>\n\t\tVậy chi phí mua nguyên liệu của công ty ít nhất là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>800</mn></mrow></semantics></math> ngàn đồng.",
